## Notes on Arguments and Attributes

- `rule_id`: Leave unset to create a custom rule (forces new resource if changed).
- `id`: The rule ID (same as `rule_id`).
- `created`: `false` after adoption or import.
- `tiers`: Severity tiers: `severity`, `threshold`, `enabled`, `selector` (BE 3.0+).

## Import
Alert rules can be imported using the rule ID:
```bash
terraform import portainer_alerting_rule.high_cpu <rule-id>
```

An imported rule has `created = false`: destroying the resource leaves the rule in Portainer.
